<%# What "Check now" reads, and what it could cost: at most what its page cost when last read in full, or about an
    average list's cost for a page never read (4e). Free when no API key is set (4f). %>
<% if Verifier::CheckNow.free_only? %>
  Free: no API key is set, so no AI reads a page<%= ": its own page first, then its company's careers page" if role %>. A
  careers page that needs reading is left for your AI assistant.
<% elsif role && record.company.resolution_status != "resolved" %>
  Finds <%= record.company.name %>'s careers page first, then checks the role, its own page first: <%= check_cost(ceiling, record) %>.
<% elsif role %>
  Its own page first, free. <%= ceiling.positive? ? "#{check_cost(ceiling, record).upcase_first} if its company's careers page must be read again." : "Its company's careers page is free to read too." %>
<% elsif record.resolution_status != "resolved" %>
  Finds its careers page first<%= ", trying #{record.careers_page_url}" if record.careers_page_url %>, then reads its roles: <%= check_cost(ceiling, record) %>.
<% else %>
  <%= ceiling.positive? ? "#{check_cost(ceiling, record).upcase_first}, if its careers page changed since the last read; free if not." : "Free: read through its own board or an ATS." %>
<% end %>
